<title>FRANCE: AGF has &quot;no comment&quot; on issue report.</title>
<headline>AGF has &quot;no comment&quot; on issue report.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>French insurance group AGF declined comment on Friday about an article in the Les Echos newspaper saying the company was about to tap the markets for four billion francs because interest rates were low.</p>
<p>&quot;No comment,&quot; an AGF spokesman said.</p>
<p>Les Echos said the insurer would use an &quot;innovative&quot; instrument and the operation would be led by Goldman Sachs.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
</text>
